{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15546","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 黎逢","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上林新柳变，小苑暮天晴。\n始望和烟密，遥怜拂水轻。\n色承阳气暖，阴带御沟清。\n不厌随风弱，仍宜向日明。\n垂丝遍阁榭，飞絮触帘旌。\n渐到依依处，思闻出谷鸎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黎逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}